  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"ja\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0lq-1-elbcplu.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0qt5176on4p23.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0dgq26a5_oy.a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/07lhk_q6pmm3r.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0beb5ex4nim4n.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-17cwzxpqqh4k8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0auusqi.42_2r.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Lumen Log</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"悶々とする救急医の、投資と資産と身体の記録\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0x3dzn~oxb6tn.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E8E4DF;background-color:var(--background);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50\"><div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><a style=\"font-family:Palatino, serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--foreground)\" href=\"/\">Lumen Log</a><nav style=\"display:flex;gap:28px\" class=\"hidden-mobile\"><a style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--indigo);font-family:sans-serif\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--indigo);font-family:sans-serif\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a><a style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--indigo);font-family:sans-serif\" href=\"/about\">About</a></nav><button class=\"show-mobile\" style=\"background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:4px;display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\" aria-label=\"メニュー\"><span style=\"display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background-color:var(--foreground);transition:transform 0.2s;transform:none\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background-color:var(--foreground);transition:opacity 0.2s;opacity:1\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background-color:var(--foreground);transition:transform 0.2s;transform:none\"></span></button></div></header><main style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:8px\">Tools</h1><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.8rem;font-family:sans-serif;margin-bottom:48px;line-height:1.6\">投資・健康・資産設計のための自作ツール群。一部は一般公開中。</p><ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0\"><li style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E8E4DF;padding:24px 0\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block\" href=\"/tools/portfolio\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-family:sans-serif;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.1em\">INVESTMENT</span></div><p style=\"font-family:Palatino, serif;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:6px\">Portfolio</p><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.6\">米国株・日本株の保有銘柄をリアルタイム価格で管理。損益・評価額を円換算で表示。</p></a></li><li style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E8E4DF;padding:24px 0\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block\" href=\"/tools/health\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-family:sans-serif;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.1em\">HEALTH</span></div><p style=\"font-family:Palatino, serif;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:6px\">Health Dashboard</p><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.6\">Garminデータ×当直記録を統合。睡眠・心拍・パフォーマンスの相関を可視化。</p></a></li><li style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E8E4DF;padding:24px 0\"><div style=\"opacity:0.5;cursor:default\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-family:sans-serif;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.1em\">PLANNING</span><span style=\"font-size:0.65rem;font-family:sans-serif;padding:2px 8px;background-color:#E8E4DF;border-radius:4px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.05em\">COMING SOON</span></div><p style=\"font-family:Palatino, serif;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:6px\">Asset Simulator</p><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.6\">積立・取り崩しシナリオを複数比較。FIRE到達時期の逆算もできる資産シミュレーター。</p></div></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:48px;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:sans-serif\">* Coming Soon のツールは順次公開予定。</p></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0qt5176on4p23.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[55672,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0auusqi.42_2r.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0auusqi.42_2r.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0auusqi.42_2r.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0auusqi.42_2r.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nc:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0auusqi.42_2r.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0lq-1-elbcplu.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"tools\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"tools\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",16],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"